msgid "«{0}» está llena ({1}/{2})."
msgstr "「{0}」已满员（{1}/{2}）。"

#. Key:	CodeIncomplete
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/Multiplayer/MP_GameInstance.cpp(2074)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/Multiplayer/MP_GameInstance.cpp(2074)
