msgid "El anfitrión te ha expulsado de la sala."
msgstr "房主把你踢出了房间。"

#. Key:	KickedNotice
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/Multiplayer/MP_GameInstance.cpp(2390)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/Multiplayer/MP_GameInstance.cpp(2390)
