msgid "Meterse o salir del caparazón"
msgstr "缩进或钻出龟壳"

#. Key:	CtlInteract
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Briefing/TN_BriefingWidget.cpp(521)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Briefing/TN_BriefingWidget.cpp(521)
